    <briefdescription>
<para>Retrieve list of PEs associated with a domain decomposition. The 1D version of this call returns an array of the PEs assigned to this 1D domain decomposition. In addition the optional argument pos may be used to retrieve the 0-based position of the domain local to the calling PE, i.e., <computeroutput> domain%list(pos)%pe</computeroutput> is the local PE, as returned by <ref refid="group__mpp__mod_1gacfeba7de56f9dd6000b3fd78f9d56c50" kindref="member">mpp_pe()</ref>. The 2D version of this call is identical to 1D version. </para>    </briefdescription>
